   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Before + infinitive",
     "texto": [
      "**Prima di** + infinitive expresses an earlier action when the same subject is understood: **Prima di partire, faccio colazione** (before leaving, I have breakfast).",
      "For a simple sequence **dopo + noun** is used (**dopo pranzo**, after lunch) or **dopo che** + conjugated verb (**dopo che mangio**, after I eat). **Dopo aver mangiato** exists, but it is a past infinitive form that will be studied later."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Connectors",
     "texto": [
      "**o** (or), **invece** (instead), **allora** (so / then), **infatti** (in fact / indeed), **perciò** (therefore), **non solo… ma anche** (not only… but also).",
      "**Infatti** introduces an explanation or confirmation; **perciò** presents a consequence."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "tabla",
     "titulo": "Connector",
     "columnas": [
